  "Speed Limit Card": "限速信息卡片",
  "Big-screen card: the speed limit sunnypilot resolved (longitudinalPlanSP). Display only; on by default.": "显示 sunnypilot 解析出的道路限速；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Blindspot Ambient Lights": "盲区氛围灯",
  "Turns the cabin ambient lights red while a car is in the blind spot.": "盲区有车辆时，将车内氛围灯变为红色。",
  "Lead Card": "前车信息卡片",
  "Big-screen card: distance and relative speed of the lead car (radarState). Display only; on by default.": "显示雷达报告的前车距离和相对速度；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Battery (BMS)": "电池状态（BMS）",
  "Big-screen tile: battery charge, pack voltage, current and power from the BMS messages on the vehicle bus. Needs the vehicle-bus harness. Read only.": "从车辆总线的 BMS 报文读取电量、电压、电流和功率并显示；需要车辆总线线束，仅作读取。",
  "External Compute": "外部计算",
  "Lets a laptop, LLM server or accelerator exchange data with the device over a cable or WiFi (TCP JSON lines). Peers need the token in /data/params/d/XpilotExternalToken.": "允许笔记本、大模型服务器或计算设备通过有线或无线网络交换建议数据；连接端需要设备私有访问令牌。",
  "IP Tile": "网络地址磁贴",
  "Big-screen tile: the device IP address and network type. Display only; on by default.": "显示设备 IP 地址和网络类型；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Phone side-vehicle vision": "手机侧方车辆视觉",
  "Optional original single wide-camera vehicle detection transport,640pixels,max4Hz; no camera while disabled.": "可选的原有单目前广角取图与车辆识别传输，图像宽度 640 像素、最高每秒 4 帧；关闭后不取图。",
  "Auto Speed Limit": "自动限速巡航",
  "Sets cruise speed to the car's speed limit plus an offset. Needs openpilot longitudinal and the vehicle bus.": "根据车辆识别的限速及偏移值设置巡航速度；需要 openpilot 纵向控制和车辆总线连接。",
  "Map Tile": "地图信息磁贴",
  "Big-screen tile: speed limit, road name and next maneuver from any map or navigation provider. Display only; on by default.": "显示地图或导航数据源提供的限速、道路名称及下一转向；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Car Tile": "车辆状态磁贴",
  "Big-screen tile: cluster speed, gear, blinkers and blind spots. Display only; on by default.": "显示仪表车速、挡位、转向灯和盲区状态；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Clock Tile": "时钟磁贴",
  "Big-screen tile: local time and date. Display only; on by default.": "显示本地时间和日期；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Traffic Light Control (Experimental)": "红绿灯控制（实验性）",
  "Stops for red lights seen by the car's own traffic-control perception. Only ever slows down.": "根据车辆自身交通灯感知对红灯停车，只允许降低速度。",
  "Speed Card": "车速信息卡片",
  "Big-screen card: ego speed and the set speed. Display only; on by default.": "显示本车车速和设定巡航速度；仅作显示，默认开启。",
  "Navigation Assist (phone)": "导航辅助（手机）",
  "Exclusive TesNav v3 or CPdazi v2 navigation source; shared bounded route-lane preparation, native Tesla/BSM veto and maneuver speed ceiling. No passing or stereo features.": "独占接收特会开或 CP 搭子导航数据，提供有限时的导航变道准备、原车与盲区否决以及转弯速度上限；不包含主动超车或双目功能。",
  "TN Longitudinal (TN-NoDEC)": "TN 纵向控制（TN-NoDEC）",
  "Replaces SP's longitudinal plan, including lead following, with the TN-NoDEC planner (legacy cruise-obstacle MPC and TN acceleration controller). Prebuilt acados solvers: installs only on the platform it was built for. TN's stopping policy in controlsd is not included.": "使用 TN-NoDEC 规划器替换 SP 纵向规划及跟车计划。需要匹配平台的预编译求解器；不包含 TN 在控制进程中的停车策略。",
  "openpilot Model": "openpilot 驾驶模型",
  "Drive with the model that ships with openpilot (selfdrive/modeld, no downloads). Replaces the SP model manager while on; switch it off to go back.": "使用随 openpilot 提供的驾驶模型，无需下载。开启后替换 SP 模型管理器，关闭后恢复原模型。",
  "Blind Spot Edges": "屏幕盲区提示",
